Shader fixes for Donkey Kong Bananza, backported onto the pinned Eglantine as one patch
(overlapping patches would defeat apply-eglantine-patches.sh's already-applied check):
geometry shaders (Eglantine 45bd8157e4), MUFU with a uniform source (6a10b27507), F2I from a
half (9e368c2918), more integer forms (2b8002474d), LDC sub-word sizes, F2I ceil and 8-bit results.
